#: lib/ui/editor.js:476
msgid ""
"Click or drag: the row sets how many windows the column holds. Right-click "
"removes a column."
msgstr ""
"Fes clic o arrossega: la fila determina quantes finestres té la columna. El "
"clic dret elimina una columna."

